rk to relax in the sun with my Pokemon!"AThe nice weather has put me in a good mood. Here, have this!"QYou can use Sunny Day in the field during daytime to make the weather sunny."'\V[25]? Huh, where's your uniform?"-Come over on this side, they'll see you!"<Alright, so this is the rare Pokémon that we're after."�Here's what I'm thinking. I distract the trainer and then you come in and trick the Pokémon into thinking that you're its trainer."LIt should follow you without any problem if you wear a decent disguise."JIt's part Slowbro, so how smart can it be! It should be easy to fool."<That policeman over there could be a problem, though..."&We'll have to be extra careful..."~Okay, I'll wait over here, go get yourself a convincing disguise. Make sure that you look exactly like this Slowbro's trainer!"/Perfect, you found the exact same clothes."HHmm... These clothes look similar, but they're not the right color!"FHmm... No, these clothes won't do. That won't trick the Pokémon."xIt looks like she's wearing some kind of school uniform. You might be able to find something similar at the mart..."5But you're going to need to take off that hat..."]And you even got the same haircut, that's some dedication. It's as if I'm seeing double!"_Alright, time for me to do my part! Wait until she's not looking to go snag that Pokémon."Here I go!"wHmm... I wonder if it'll really be tricked by that haircut though... You can probably get one at the city's hotel."OGo get yourself a convincing disguise to look like this Slowbro's trainer."YYou can probably buy some clothes from the PokéMart and get a haircut at the hotel."}Er-hem. Step right up! You won't believe all of the rare items that we're giving away today for our exclusive promotion!"0Trust me, you won't want to miss any of it!"JYou, young lass! Come over here, I've got just the rare item for you!"4Ughh, why is it so dark? I can't see a thing..."ELECTBRO, ROLLOUT!"jI fused Slowbro with a fast Pokémon to offset its weaknesses! Mi