hto region, professor Elm and he tasked me to give you a Pokémon to commemorate your victory."/Now, which one of those three do you want?"EGreat choice! I'm sure this Pokémon will be in excellent hands."@There is also another thing that my colleague mentionned..."9Are you familiar with the legendary Pokémon Mewtwo?"�It was created by some scientists in Cinnabar Island some time ago. But one day, it fled the mansion and hasn't been seen ever since."EIt is said to be one of the most powerful Pokémon in existance."yRecently, my colleague Professor Elm in Johto came across some new information concerning the whereabouts of Mewtwo."gHe says he'd need the assistance of a strong trainer, so I thought you'd be the perfect candidate."His lab is located in New Bark Town in the Johto region. It's a long way from here, but do you think you could pay him a visit?"oPlease! Professor Elm would greatly benefit from the field experience of a powerful trainer like yourself."!Won't you please reconsider?"}Great! Then it's settled. Go meet my colleague Professor Elm in New Bark Town and he'll give you some more instructions!"8I worked with Professor Oak designing the Pokédex."$It really is an amazing device!"4This ball contains Squirtle, the water Pokemon."$Do you want to choose Squirtle?"Yes"No"Treecko"Torchic"Mudkip"Chikorita"Cyndaquil"Totodile"	Sure"Not really...Iu;␀`[["DTrainer Tips: You can change the game's control by pressing F1."$Hey! You're a Pokémon trainer?"I'm a new trainer too!"IWe should have our Pokémon battle each other to make them stronger!"5That's what Pokémon trainers do when they meet!"7Woah! Your Pokémon looks like a total powerhouse!"7Viridian City isn't too far uphill, don't give up!"4Avoid the tall grass if your Pokémon are hurt!"_Hi, I work at a Pokemon Mart. It's a convenient shop, so please visit us in Viridian City!"Here, have a sample!"2We also carry Pokeballs for catching Pokemon!["DTrainer Tips: You can change the game's control by p