on that's native to the Unova region!"SYes! I learned about those during my adventure! The memories are flowing back!"4\C[3]\PN unlocked the Kalos outfits collection!"7\C[3]\PN unlocked the Kalos hairstyles collection!"HI just came back from the Kalos region, it was quite the adventure!"LKalos is home to so many elegant Pokémon, Oh, I wish to see one again!"JWill you please show me a Pokémon that's native to the Kalos region?"XHmm.. That won't do it. I need to see a Pokémon that's native to the Kalos region!"%Oh my! How precious, how exotic!"SYes! I fought one of those during my adventure! The memories are flowing back!"4\C[3]\PN unlocked the Alola outfits collection!"7\C[3]\PN unlocked the Alola hairstyles collection!"HI just came back from the Alola region, it was quite the adventure!"KAlola is home to so many exotic Pokémon, Oh, I wish to see one again!"JWill you please show me a Pokémon that's native to the Alola region?"XHmm.. That won't do it. I need to see a Pokémon that's native to the Alola region!"WYes! I caught one of those during my adventure too! The memories are flowing back!"fThanks for showing me all of these Pokémon. They brought back some great memories of my travels."DI've been all over the world and I love to share my adventures!"pI gave the store some more outfits that I've discovered during one of these adventures in the Galar region!"4\C[3]\PN unlocked the Galar outfits collection!"7\C[3]\PN unlocked the Galar hairstyles collection!"zAnd I also gave the store some more outfits that I've discovered during one of these adventures in the Paldea region!"5\C[3]\PN unlocked the Paldea outfits collection!"8\C[3]\PN unlocked the Paldea hairstyles collection!"eI hope that these outfits I donated will inspire young trainers to go out on adventures like me!"6... And I also have one last thing, just for you!"AThese are the clothes I've worn during all of my adventures!"^I hope that this'll inspire <i>you</i> to go out on some more adventures of your own t