 of Pokémon and trainers from all around the world would come here."?Which of course would be great for Team Rocket's business."_I can release the virus right now at the press of only a few buttons on this very machine."2I have to agree with Mr. Fuji here, Giovanni."WThis is absolutely insane and completely irresponsible! We cannot let you do that!"Oh, is that so Professor?"Well in that case..."BWhy don't you give our guests here a taste of what's to come?">What!? How were you able to defeat those fused Pokémon!?"How annoying."WThough I have to admit, those are some impressive battling skills for two old men."&But now let's get this over with."4Mewtwo, won't you please come greet our guests."I... I don't believe it!"How..."How could it be?".It looks like you were able to stop me..."2I must admit, I really did not see it coming."�Still, I might not have been able to spread the virus around the region, but we plan on marketing DNA Splicers and making them easily available for all trainers."BPokémon fusion is still about to become reality nonetheless!":So, what did you think of Mewtwo? Powerful, isn't it?"&So, are you impressed, professor?"Hmm..."[I will now go on with the plan and use Cinnabar Island's volcano to release the virus."1Soon fused Pokemon will be found everywhere."MAnd there's absolutely nothing that you two old men can do about it now!"XPokémon are sentient beings, you cannot just force two of them into a single body.";Well, it looks like our secret plan has been unveiled."u...It doesn't matter. I can release the virus right now at the press of only a few buttons on this very machine.".This is crazy! We cannot let you do that!"Let's get this over with."DPokémon fusion is still about to become a reality nonetheless!"BJust... Perhaps not to the extent of what it could have been."Hahaha haha![@"OWhat you have before your eyes is the most powerful Pokémon in existence."This is Mewtwo."vWe have engineered Mewtwo by cloning the DNA of Mew, the ances