roblem once and for all!"sI saw a patch of \C[2]Red Flowers\C[0] growing near Mt. Moon. Surely the bird Pokémon will leave those alone."<I would be very grateful if you could pick some for me."IThat's it! Those are precisely the blue flowers I was talking about!"8Here's a another little something for your trouble."3I'll go ahead and plant these flowers for you."5Misery! It's fond of these blue flowers as well!"!Huh? Won't you look at this!"fIt looks like the bird Pokémon has taken a real liking to you for bringing all of these flowers!"'Oricorio wants to join your party!"8Oricorio forced itself into one of your PokéBalls!"[Well that's certainly one way to solve this problem. I'm quite grateful for your help!"!And so is Oricorio it seems!"9Here's one last reward for helping with all of this."iNow make sure to feed Oricorio plenty of nectar from all the colored flowers you find along the way!"uIf you could find some \C[1]Blue Flowers\C[0], then I'm sure that this would solve our problem once and for all."xI don't think I've ever seen any on this side of Mt. Moon, so surely the bird Pokémon won't be familiar with them!"$You're looking for some bricks?"sSure, I've got them. But I'm not handing them to you unless you beat me in a Pokémon battle! What do you say?"*Watch out, I'm not going down easily!"-Woah! You're way better than I expected!"4You're good. Here are the bricks you asked for!"9I'm not giving you these bricks unless you fight me!"+So, what were those bricks for anyway?"9I'm quite grateful for your help with this Oricorio!"RI'll make sure to tend to all these flowers you brought with the utmost care."OWhen you're having trouble in a trainer battle, you're allowed to forfeit!"DYou should always stop by the hotel when you get to a new city."RThey're always full of people seeking help from travelling Pokémon trainers!"&Did you check out the Museum yet?"1Those fossils were incredible, weren't they?""Which one was your favourite?"$Really!? You really have to go!"\