\V[1]"q\PN! I've watched you defeat all these Gym Leaders. You truly are the greatest Pokémon trainer of them all."RYou should go back to the Elite Four if you want to truly challenge yourself!"Now that's entertainment!"2Hey! The promise we made! Let's battle again!"0This is war! I'll shock you into surrender!"$What a shocking turn of events!"BOh no! You are very strong! But I will repay my debt someday."-You promised me a battle, remember that!"8Oof... I'm all out of juice! Maybe in a few days..."$Um... ...hello. Shall we start?"Well done..."True to your reputation..."Oh... I understand..."9Um... Keep on doing your best... with your Pokémon."LMaybe we can have another battle again later... Um... If you want to..."*Woah! Those are some hardcore fights!"%I can't wait for the next fight!".I never break my promises! Are you ready?"7You really are strong! But I won't lose next time!"Whenever you're ready!"-That was fun, let's do this again later!"oHow are you? Good to see you again! This place doesn't really suit me, but...let's ignore that and battle!"BYour Pokémon have truly blossomed. What a beautiful bouquet!"$You have grown even stronger...".I'll just have a small nap while waiting."LThe battle made me a bit sleepy. I think I'll dose off for a while now!"LI'm taking notes on every fight. One day I'll be the one battling here!"VHeh! What do ye know, ye defeated all of them Gym Leaders while wearing my badge."-Ye really are something else. Take this."]Imma head out now. Come see me at the league if ye ever find all three of these emblems."n\PN! Ye think yer tough? Well, beat all these Gym Leaders wearing my badge if ye really want to prove it!"LYa beat \V[165] Gym Leaders while wearing my badge. That's pretty good!"JBut ya gotta beat all 16 of them if ya wanna prove how tough you are!"Woah! Cool match!"YHello, young one. My name is Kurt, I have studied \V[5] Pokémon for my entire life."oI will teach you not to undererstimate \V[5]-type Pokémon! Champion or not, get ready for some schooling!":Unbeliavable. Very well, you can have the Hive badge.">You can also have this TM. It's an old favourite of mine!"YNow excuse me, but I must leave. Come pay me a visit a my house if you fancy a chat."Heal your Pokémon?"Yes"No[~"wFwahahaha! Today I'll not only defeat you, but I will also demonstrate my dignity to everyone here! Are you ready?"#You're just full of surprises!"5Fwahahaha! You're even stronger than I remember."(I will wait for you in the shadows."i...If I am not strong enough to defeat you now, there is but one thing to do. I must hone my skills."*Gym Leaders fight with such elegance."EThis reminds me of a tournament in my home region. This is cool!"$This was intense! I'm sweating!"%Good to see you! Shall we begin?"1I expected no less from the League Champion!" Very well. I'm in no hurry.";Let's not hurry things up to much. We can fight later."2I was just talking about you... Let's battle!"How is this possible..."GI've lost again... You may have something more than just strength."2I understand... you must be busy with things."eI'm desperate to know the secret of your strength. Please allow me to fight you once more later."6I've never seen so many Gym Leaders in one place!"<Nice to see you, \PN. You came to fight me, didn't you?",All right! Time to fulfill our promise!"I took you for granted!"BI've lost again... You aren't adventuring around for nothing!"2Come back when you are ready to challenge me!"<Let's wait a bit before we have our next rematch, okay?"[I knew you'd come! I had a feeling. What? We promised each other, so it's no surprise?">Well, you may be right. So, shall we have our battle now?"8I knew you'd win, but the fight was still worth it."1I know... You will fight me again some time."I knew you'd say that."0You need to rest. Our next battle can wait."WHello, \PN. Mt. Moon looks very majestic at this time of the day, don't you agree?"VI like to come here to admire the rock formations whenever I have some free time."�I still remember that battle we had a while back. You were only a beginning trainer but I could already sense the determination in your eyes."4But you've become incredibly strong since then."lMeet me at the Battle Arena in Vermillion City if you want to battle me again. I'll be waiting for you!"Look at them go!"SHi! I've been waiting for you! It's a pleasure to be able to battle you again!"Should we begin?"?Mmm... It's still a long way to become the best Trainer..."Whenever you're ready."BMy Pokémon need to rest a bit. We'll be ready in a few days!"jFinally. No need for words. A Pokémon battle is the way for us to communicate. Shall we do this now?"Mmm... Impressive!!"=Yes, yes... Quite impressive. You can overcome anything."PThat's OK, too. People ought to have their own ideas. That's the way it is."jIf it's someone like you, I'm sure you'll keep winning and will find something important. Keep it up."NIf you like watching good Pokémon battles, then this is the place to be!"4You keep your word. That's a good thing, kiddo!" So, you're ready to battle?"<I have burned out, but my spirit has not been defeated!"Take your time."KMy spirit hasn't been defeated, but it will take some time to recover."�So here you are. Don't make me wait! I've heard a lot of good things about you since our last battle. Let me test how good you are!"5You truly deserve that title of League Champion!"1Wow! You are getting stronger by the battle!"5Humph, I'm tired! We can have our rematch later!"'...You are here. Now let's battle!"%Way to go. Now give it your all!"*Huh? Where's your eagerness to fight?")Way to go. ... Now give it your all!",We should have another battle sometime!".There you are! Taste my 24-hour training!"#Hmm... I lost? How about that!"/Wahaha! A battle with you is never boring!"Argh... That's too bad!"Ay!";Hmmm! I enjoyed battling you. Let's do it again later!"/Is that a Gym Leader? This should be good!"@As promised, we will face off against each other once more."JI expect you to give it all you got. You can expect the same from me."Shall we begin?";Haarg! I lose?! There is nothing I wish to say to you!"Farewell, then."XYou have made me see the errors of my ways. For that, I am forever grateful to you."d\PN! This place was built for Gym Leaders to gather and have fierce battles against each other."TYou're the League Champion, so of course you're allowed to participate as well!"LYou should go out and try to convince some Gym Leaders to join us here!"DYou might be able to find them out and about around the region."
