rIu;␀� [[=">Hey! Turn back! This is a top-secret investigation scene!"7Aghh, you've seen everything already, haven't you?"JWell then it can't be helped. We might as well make use of your help."aOk then... What I'm about to tell you is highly classified information, so listen carefully."fThe crater you see here was made by a strange object that fell out of the sky a few nights ago..."uAt first we believed that it was a meteor, but this object's composition is unlike any meteor we've seen before."ZAfter running some tests on it, we now believe that it is part of an alien spaceship."8I know... It's hard to believe, but it's the truth!"�But this is just some debris so it's no use to us at the moment. However, we believe that the rest of the ship might've fallen elsewhere."lAccording to witnesses, the ship burst into three separate parts shortly after entering the atmosphere."�We've been unable to locate the other two pieces so far, but we believe that one of them might be the spaceship's main component."~One meteor was reported in the \C[3]Johto region\C[0], \C[1]East of Goldenrod City\C[0] around the same time as this one."]Another one was reported in the \C[5]Kanto region\C[0], \C[1]South of Fuchsia City.\C[0]"ZWe need you to go investigate these two areas for signs of the ship's main component."ZAnd please be discreet about it. Remember that all of this is classified information!"kAccording to witnesses the ship burst into three separate parts shortly after entering the atmosphere."eSo you've been able to locate the impact points of the other two meteors? That's fantastic news!"�Hmm... But it seems like these Spaceship Parts you found are nothing but debris. We're no closer to finding the ship's main component."SAghh! To think we've come so far just to find ourselves in another dead-end..."Unless..."�That's it! Using the positions from the three meteors' impact points, I should be able to triangulate the main ship's coordinates!""Give me a few seconds here..