is was my last pair!"Good luck on your journey!":\PN before you leave, could you please do me a favor?"HI need you to pick up a parcel at Viridian City's PokéMart for me."AIt's just down the road, but I forgot to pick it up earlier.")\PN, could you please do me a favor?"CIt's not very far from here and it would help me a great deal."LOh \PN! How is my old Pokémon doing? Well, it seems to like you a lot."%What? You have something for me?" \PN delivered Oak's Parcel.";Ah! This is the custom PokéBall I ordered! Thank you!"nAnd I can see they gave you some DNA Splicers as well. How convenient since you've just become a trainer!"HBut of course, you'll need a second Pokémon before you can use it."VHere, I'll give you some Poké Balls so you can catch some Pokémon to try it on!"wYou can always defuse your Pokémon if you don't like the result, but it will lose some experience in the process."GOh and did you get some DNA Splicers while you were there as well?"PYou didn't? Oh, that's no problem. You can always return to buy some later!" There's also another thing."FI forgot to give you your Pokédex before you headed out earlier!"\PN obtained the Pokédex!"3I already gave my grandson his before he left."lThe Pokédex automatically records data on Pokémon you've seen or caught! It's a hi-tech encyclopedia!"}There are over 175,000 species of Pokémon when you consider Pokémon Fusion, so I cannot possibly expect you to complete it."LBut you should still try to catch as many different species as you can!"<Now go! Your journey to the Pokémon League starts now!":Did you talk to my colleague, Professor Elm in Johto?"mCongratulations on getting all of these Johto gym badges It isn't an easy task that you've accomplished!"�I have one more Pokémon to give you. You can have one of the starter Pokémon that are handed to new trainers in the Hoenn region." No, which one did you want?"oMy colleague Professor Elm in Johto came across some new information concerning the whereabouts of Mewtwo."