 small glass of strong liquor. It raises your Pokémon's Sp.Atk and Spd stats. But it also makes your Pokémon confused."oA splicer used to fuse two Pokémon together. It results in a higher-leveled fusion than regular splicers."8A small souvenir from the Fuchsia City Safari Zone."�A digital encyclopedia that records data on every Pokémon encountered. It can be used in battles to display the opponent Pokémon's type."SA card-type key that unlocks doors in Silph Co.'s Head Office in Saffron City."EA freshly baked pizza. It could probably be sold for some money."7A key to open the captain's room on the S.S. Anne."uA peculiar low capture rate Ball that switches the caught Pokémon gender. It won't work on genderless Pokémon."kA peculiar low capture rate Ball that makes the caught Pokémon gain boosted exp as if it were traded."]A peculiar very low capture rate Ball that unlocks the caught Pokémon's hidden ability."ZA peculiar very low capture rate Ball that infects the caught Pokémon with Pokérus."[A peculiar low capture rate Ball that makes the caught Pokémon sparkle when sent out."uA peculiar extremely low capture rate Ball that makes the caught Pokémon as strong as possible in  a few stats."LAn old, worn-out leather boot. It's trash, but someone might like it..."dFuses the DNA of two Pokémon to create a new species. Can be reused as many times as you like."QAn item that can be used to share experience gained with every party member."BA mysterious parcel that is meant to be delivered to someone."5A key to the abandonned power plant on Route 10."PThis item has been removed from the game. It can be safely sold or deleted."QThis item has been removed from the game. It can be safely sold or deleted.1"NA peculiar stone that forces any Pokémon to evolve, regardless of level."RA peculiar spray that forces any Pokémon to revert back to its earlier form."EA peculiar stone that turns a Pokémon into the opposite gender."=A flag that allows you to forfeit a trainer battle once."jA gem with an essence of fairies. When held, it strengthens the power of a Fairy-type move only once."LA somewhat different Poké Ball that makes a wild Pokémon fall asleep."BA somewhat different Poké Ball that poisons a wild Pokémon."DA somewhat different Poké Ball that paralyzes a wild Pokémon."@A somewhat different Poké Ball that burns a wild Pokémon."BA somewhat different Poké Ball that freezes a wild Pokémon."[A somewhat different Poké Ball that works better on a Pokémon with no status ailment"ZA somewhat different Poké Ball that works better on a Pokémon with a status ailment"LA Poké Ball that makes the caught Pokémon gain 5 levels upon capture."VA splicer that reverses the DNA of a fused Pokémon to create the inverse fusion."IA full meal given to Team Rocket employees. It's surprisingly tasty!">A full meal from a fancy restaurant. It tastes fantastic."AA portable incubator that is used to instantly hatch an egg.">A small explosive that hurts a wild Pokémon when thrown."bA pass that allows you to take the Seagallop Ferry from Cinnabar Island to the Sevii Islands."CA common poisonous mushroom. It can be sold for a small price."QAn item that can be used to share experience gained with every party member."EA mask that lets you breathe in areas filled with poisonous gas."EGuarantees Critical-Hits, but makes the user miss half the time.";An Ice Pick that lets you climb vertical walls of ice."OA folding Bicycle that enables much faster movement than a regular bicycle"KA rare gem that is used for making jewelry. It sells for a high price."JA necklace made from a Diamond and Pearls. It sells for a high price."8A ring made out of gold. It sells for a high price."hThe dorsal fin of Seadra that is used as an ingredient in some medicine. It sells for a high price."TAn ancient, secret medicine. It fully revives all fainted Pokémon in a battle."kA capsule that allows a Pokémon with two Abilities to switch between these Abilities when it is used."TA pair of magic boots that allow