unching a punch. It will fail if the user is hit before it is used."FThe target is infested and unable to flee for four to five turns."jThe user drains the target's blood. The user's HP is restored by half the damage taken by the target."aStriking opponents repeatedly makes the user's fists harder, raising the user's Attack stat."`The user strikes the target with a quick jolt of electricity. This attack cannot be evaded."KThe user stabs the target with a sharp horn. This attack never misses."VThe target is hit with wings of steel. It may also raise the user's Defense stat."`The user attacks driven by frustration. Power increases if the user's previous move failed."aThe user attacks the target's throat. The target cannot use sound-based moves for two turns."AIt looks just like a regular TM, but it doesn't do anything."_The user shoots boiling hot water at its target. It may also leave the target with a burn."KA cable exuding a mysterious energy. It’s loved by certain Pokémon."hA Pokéball that is completely invisble to the human eye. You shouldn't be able to obtain this item"WA strange mirror that allows you to peak into the Dream World for a brief instant."A small, portable device that allows you to access the Pokémon storage system. There are some places where it won't work."lA fossil from a prehistoric Pokémon that once lived on the land. It appears to be part of a large jaw."oAn item to be held by a Pokémon. This offensive vest raises Sp. Def but prevents the use of status moves."fAn item to be held by a Pokémon. They protect the holder from weather-related damage and powder."eAn item to be held by a Pokémon. They protect the holder from effects caused by making contact."cAn item to be held by a Pokémon. It extends the duration of the terrain caused by the holder."gAn item to be held by a Pokémon. It boosts Defense on Electric Terrain. It can only be used once."fAn item to be held by a Pokémon. It boosts Sp. Def on Psychic Terrain. It can only be used once."dAn item to be held by a Pokémon. It boosts Sp. Def on Misty Terrain. It can only be used once."eAn item to be held by a Pokémon. It boosts Defense on Grassy Terrain. It can only be used once."qAn item to be held by a Pokémon. It boosts Sp. Def if hit by a Water-type attack. It can only be used once."oAn item to be held by a Pokémon. It boosts Attack if hit by an Ice-type attack. It can only be used once."vAn item to be held by a Pokémon. The holder's Attack and Sp. Atk sharply increase if hit by a move it's weak to."bAn item to be held by a Pokémon. It boosts Speed when intimidated. It can be used only once."PThis item has been removed from the game. It can safely be sold or deleted."XA mysterious prism that was found in a dark cave. It's unclear what its purpose is."`A mysterious fruit that was found growing in the darkness. It appears to have a faint glow."uA fossil from a prehistoric Pokémon that once lived on the land. It looks like the impression from a skin sail."GCrystalized light that can allow Necrozma to turn into a new form."TAn old tablet that seems like it could be used to decypher an ancient language."RA collection of nostalgic merchandise with the logo of a legendary Pokéband."=A handy sleeping bag that can be used to sleep anywhere."]A feather that glows like the moon. It's said to possess the power to dispel nightmares."aA lunar feather that has been corrupted. It's said to possess the power to cause nightmares."IA key that unlocks a secret door in the Lavender Town Pokémon House"gThe full uniform that every Team Rocket grunt wears. Putting it on might get you some odd looks..."fA soft and sweet treat made of fluffy, puffy and whirled cream. It's loved by a certain Pokémon."`A key that operates the elevator in the Team Rocket Hideout. It bears the Team Rocket logo."fA type of Berry that is only found on Pinkan Island. This berry turns Pokémon that eats it pink."[A small whistle that emits a loud, high-pitched noise. It can be used to alert others."OAllows you to quickly switch to the outfit you've marked as your favorite."]A nifty kit that can be used to dye your hats in different colours from the Outfits menu"`A nifty kit that can be used to dye your clothes in different colours from the Outfits menu"VA case that contains mechanical parts of some sort made by the Devon Corporation."bDelicate spores harvested from a large mushroom in Petalburg Woods. It might have some use..."AA handy field sleeping bag that can be used to nap anywhere."iA candy that is packed with energy. If consumed, it grants a Pokémon a small number of Exp. Points.":A bunch of seaweed that's common in the Hoenn region."MWeakens a supereffective Fairy-type attack against the holding Pokémon."EA can of colored spray paint that can be used to paint on walls."&Debug tool for spawning Pokémon."*A small gift box that contains coins.";Some kind of object. You're not too sure what it is...[�0"Stench"Drizzle"Speed Boost"Battle Armor"Sturdy"	Damp"Limber"Sand Veil"Static"Volt Absorb"Water Absorb"Oblivious"Cloud Nine"Compound Eyes"Insomnia"Color Change"Immunity"Flash Fire"Shield Dust"Own Tempo"Suction Cups"Intimidate"Shadow Tag"Rough Skin"Wonder Guard"Levitate"Effect Spore"Synchronize"Clear Body"Natural Cure"Lightning Rod"Serene Grace"Swift Swim"Chlorophyll"Illuminate"
