 such as Jolteon will be able to learn the move Spiky Shield."Xonly a ground-type fusion of Grimer or Muk will be able to learn the move Shore Up."sany ice-type fusion that can already learn the move Crabhammer will also be able to learn the move Ice Hammer."only water-type fusions of a ninja-like Pokémon such as Ninjask or Zoroark will be able to learn the move Water Shuriken."many Rotom fusion that can already learn the move Thunder Punch can also be taught the move Plasma Fists."oonly an Electric-type fusion of a legendary Ice-type Pokémon will be able to learn the move Freeze Shock."fonly a Fire-type fusion of a legendary Ice-type Pokémon will be able to learn the move Ice Burn."aany Pokémon that is both Flying and Dark type will be able to learn the move Oblivion Wing."pa ground-type fusion of a spiky Pokémon such as Ferrothorn will be able to learn the move Thousand Arrows."pany steel-type Pokémon that can already learn the move Double Slap will be able to learn Double Iron Bash."`any Pokémon that is both Fairy and Rock type will be able to learn the move Diamond Storm."pany water-type Pokémon that can already learn the move Eruption can also be taught the move Steam Eruption"4Get ready! Here comes the final round!\wtnp[10]"4Get ready! Here comes the first round!\wtnp[10]".Get ready! Here comes round {1}!\wtnp[10]"JThat's it for round {1}. You've cumulated {2} points so far.\wtnp[20]"0Are you ready to move on to the next round?"{You still have {1} rounds to go. You'll only keep your points if you finish all {2} rounds. Do you really want to quit now?"CThis concludes our quiz! You've cumulated {1} points in total."!Thanks for playing!\wtnp[20]"*Which Pokémon is this fusion's body?"Next question!\wtnp[10]"*Which Pokémon is this fusion's head?"KOkay, now's your chance to make up for the points you missed!\wtnp[15]"<Wow! A perfect round! You get {1} more points!\wtnp[15]"9Let's see what this Pokémon looked like...\wtnp[20]"It's... \C[1]{1}\C[0]!"Streak: {1}"+