 after the beach. The pearls are made of recycled plastic."Yellow Qipao"SA yellow qipao worn over pants. It's popular with fledgling trainers in Kanto."Youngster Outfit"UAn orange tank top and shorts that's often worn by youngsters around the region."Short Cut with Antenna"wA simple short hairstyle with an antenna that sticks up like a Heracross's, like Aaron of the Sinnoh Elite Four's."	Afro"fA full, fluffy afro that’s big, bold, and impossible to ignore, perfect for making a statement!"Baby Hair"PA single curled strand of hair that makes you look like you were just born."	Bald"OA completely bald look - no hair, no fuss, just pure, unadulterated scalp!"Messy Afro"fA flattened afro with an unkempt, rounded shape, offering a low-maintenance yet distinctive look."Bob Cut"ZA sleek bob cut with chin-length hair that frames the face with a sharp, modern edge."Bowl Cut"fA classic bowl cut with evenly trimmed hair all around, offering a neat and straightforward look."Box Braided Buns"VA half-up, half-down hairstyle featuring cute, poofy buns and elegant box braids."Box Braids"6A cascade of long, elegant, intricade box braids."Braided Buns"ZThis space-inspired hairstyle combines braids and poofy hair into one adorable updo.."Crashing Wave Mane"6A medium-length haircut often sported by surfers."Ruby Spikes"yShort hair with sharp, upward spikes at the front and crown. This style is popular with fledgling trainers in Hoenn."Short, Neat Spikes"rNeatly arranged spikes that look intimidating and disciplined. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Brock."Square-Cut Bangs"dMedium-length hair with messy square-cut bangs. This cut is usually seen on young Bug Catchers."Buzz Cut"PA clean, close-cropped buzz cut for a sharp and low-maintenance appearance."Over-Shoulder Braid".A long braid that goes over the shoulder."Ponytail Spiky Bangs"hLong, beautiful bushy hair tied in a thick ponytail. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Clair."Pointy Pompadour"UA pointy geled pompadour, to make you look like a totally normal academy student"Side Slick Fade"IA short hairstyle popular in Kalos, inspired by poison-type Pokemon."Cornrows"cNeatly braided cornrows that run close to the scalp that create a sleek and intricate pattern."Dancer"VBraids put up in a ponytail. They flow with the rhythm of the music as you dance."Twinleaf Tresses"eA long, half-updo style with blunt bangs. Popular among fledgling trainers in the Sinnoh region."Eevee Tail"@A puffy ponytail that looks just like the tail of an Eevee."Neat Backwave"zShort, combed back to hair that give a tidy and professional appearance. This style was popularized by Professor Elm."Emo Bangs"_A styled haircut with long, angled layers and sweeping bangs for a dramatic and edgy look."Bandana Straight Hair"vMedium-length hair that falls straight down around a gray bandana. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Erika."Fade Haircut"gA fade haircut with gradually shorted sides and back, blending seamlessly into longer hair on top."Droopy Bangs"mMedium-length bangs that flow beautifully in the wind. This style was popularized by Gym Leader Falkner."Side-Swept Fringe"KA bold, asymmetrical hairstyle where strands fuse into a stylish wave."Guardian Fringe"OA neat fringe that covers one eye that is styled to look like a Gardevoir."Front Spikes"wSpikes that give an air of smugness and youthful rebellion. The style is popular with fledgling trainers in Kanto."Pomeg Cut"2A cute cut that is styled like a Pomeg berry!"Glorious Bob-cut"~A short, chin-length haircut with a longer strand on the left side. Popular among fledgling trainers in the Galar region."Playhouse Ponytail"rA cute curly ponytail styled just like a Happiny. A wonderfully charming style for any fans of Baby Pokémon."Wild Locks"pThis wild mane of flowing locks is untamable, as if it was haunted. This style is popular with Hex Maniacs."High-bun">A high bun, ideal for keeping your hair out of your face."High-bun Bangs"