ader Lenora."Low Braids w/ Bangs"sLong flowing hair tied in low braids, laid over the shoulders. It's a cute, easy style for traveling trainers."Low-pony"0A low ponytail reminiscent of Lopunny's fur"Voluminous Curls"yLong, wavy hair with a distinctive side part, featuring large curls that frame the face and flow down the shoulders."Lunar Cut"LA bob cut shaped like a crescent moon, with a sleek, curved silhouette."Lupine Cut"9A sleek cut that is reminiscent of a Lycanroc's mane"Peppy Pigtails"JBouncy pigtails with a playful charm that gives off a carefree vibes."Long Teethed Ponytail"lA unique style of ponytail adorned with acessories that look just like the teethed antenna of a Mawile."Sapphire Side Tails"yMedium-length brown hair with a fringe and side-swept bangs. This style is popular with fledgling trainers in Hoenn."Flowing Twin Tails"{Long hair styled into voluminous twin tails with delicate, flowing strands that give off a magical and ethereal appearance."High Twin Tails"{Long hair styled into high, puffy twin tails with straight, side-swept bangs that give off a vibrant and playful look."Bow and Stripes"QA cute hairstyle featuring long twintails with stripey highlights and a bow."Two-Toned Afro"lAn large two-toned afro with a zigzag pattern. A very bold choice, only for the most disco of trainers."Spiky Medium Hair"iMedium-length hair that looks beautiful and youthful. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Misty."Spiky Side Pigtail"aShort, spiky hair with a spiky side ponytail. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Misty."Mod Bob"[Chin-length hairstyle with sharp and geometric lines that was popular a long time ago."Short Mohawk"oA short mohawk with the rest of the head shaved to a buzz cut. It's a style popular with punks and bikers."Elegant Mom Pony"LAn elegant hairstyle popular with moms. It's practical and fashionable!"Messy Mom Bun"KA messy hairstyle typically seen on moms who really deserve a break..."Mudkip Flip"@A spiky, flipped hairstyle inspired by the gills on Mudkip."Mullet".Business in the front, party in the back!"Fork and Knife Cut"0A hairstyle worn by those who love to cook."Short, Shaggy spikes"sShort, shaggy spikes that go well with visor-type hats. The style is popular with fledgling trainers in Unova."Accessorized Corn Rows"ALong corn rows with accesories, the last in kalosian fashion"Shaggy Ponytail"gA long, low ponytail that gives off a mysterious air. The style is popular with trainers in Unova."Joyful Puffs"RNeatly coiled twin buns perched high on each side, radiating care and warmth."Side Joyful Puff"MA single coiled bun perched high on one side, radiating care and warmth."Elegant Waves"YA sophisticated hairstyle that's popular with a lot of trainers with corporate jobs."Pom-Pom Puffs"0Big, bubbly twin puffs bursting with cheer!"Soft Side Bangs"kShort hair with soft, fluffy bangs parted to the sides, often worn by sensitive souls such as artists."Pigtails"[High, bouncy pigtails tied with ribbons, adding a fun and youthful touch to your look."Pixie Cut"nA short, playful pixie cut with closely cropped sides and a bit of length on top for a modern, airy look."Polished Scalp">A completely bald head with some polish to make it shiny!"Pompadour"HA dramatic, swept-back hairstyle with towering volume at the front."Punk Tails"BHigh, wild twin ponytails bursting with volume and rebellion."Rising Star Dreads"NStylish dreadlocks tied up in a bun. Some hang down loosely in the front."Short Hat Hair"HShort spiky hair that's been flattened by constantly wearing a hat."Edgy Asymmetrical Cut"DAn edgy, asymmetrical hairstyle with a highlight in the center."Combover"eA sleek, neatly styled combover with a side part that creates a polished and refined appearance."Long Pigtails Buns"An eye-catching hairdo with two large side buns that continue into long pigtails. It's popular with fledgling trainers in Unova"Roserade (Medium)"QMedium-length spiky hair that's styled to 